  "C0": "C0: StackVec::retain takes FnMut(&mut T)->bool, calls the predicate in original order, retains successful true elements in relative order including predicate mutations, destroys removed elements exactly once on normal completion, and preserves capacity. Predicate and destructor panic may propagate. After catch_unwind, all reachable elements must be live and owned once, length must reflect the initialized reachable region, and later safe access/drop must remain valid. No specific recovery suffix, destructor order, or leak is required on panic. Ordinary execution must not leak or blanket-clear retained elements. No new T bounds, manifest edits, or public API removal.",
